# axonal_delay_test_stdp_pl_synapse.nestml
# ########################################
#
#
# Description
# +++++++++++
#
# Spike-timing dependent plasticity with a power-law dependence of facilitation on the weight; this is equivalent to the NEST built-in models ``stdp_pl_synapse_hom`` and ``stdp_pl_synapse_hom_ax_delay``, with the presynaptic trace time constant ``tau_plus`` and the postsynaptic trace time constant ``tau_minus`` (in NEST, the latter is a parameter of the postsynaptic neuron).
#
#
